#: 503c8a2caf6f4eb499f71ab13d165d2f
msgid "Upload the firmware using the *Mission Planner* **Initial Setup \\| Install Firmware** screen's **Load custom firmware** link"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:78
#: 69bdc8c21f4542788500bbb0f474f004
msgid "ArduPilot imports addition projects (`PX4Firmware <https://github.com/ArduPilot/PX4Firmware>`__, `PX4NuttX <https://github.com/ArduPilot/PX4NuttX>`__, `uavcan <https://github.com/ArduPilot/uavcan>`__) as *git submodules* when you build the project. If you built the project before the change to submodules you may get errors. See :ref:`Git Submodules <git-submodules>` for troubleshooting information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:88
#: b7d84d2cd3014c62b614f67d5b1e590b
msgid "You can ignore any messages regarding PX4Firmware and PX4Nuttx hashes. Those are useful labels for developers but optional and sometimes the build system can't find them on your system. As long as it says \"Firmware is in..\" followed by a .px4 file then you have a successful build which you can safely load onto your aircraft."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:91
#: 88738fb92ce942c98d46fd9867b923c9
msgid "Hints for speeding up compile time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:93
#: a2f20b7527f34a04b77da81f53435dd0
msgid "Anti virus protection is likely to slow the compile times especially for PX4 so it is recommended that the folders containing the ArduPilot source code is excluded from your virus protections real-time scan."
msgstr ""

